          "solutionReview": {
            "headline": "Students are counted in whole numbers, so the relationship is separate points, from 0 students up to the 48 the bus can carry.",
            "reasoning": [
              "Discrete or continuous: x counts students, and there is no half of a student, so the relationship is discrete: separate points, not a connected graph.",
              "Domain: the bus can carry from 0 students up to at most 48, and only whole numbers of them, so the domain is {0, 1, 2, ..., 48}."
            ],
            "answerSummary": "The relationship is discrete, with domain {0, 1, 2, ..., 48}."
          }
