          "dok": 3,
          "difficultyBand": 4,
          "prompt": "Honors extension: a delivery van holds at most 30 boxes and each box weighs 4 pounds. A student claims the reasonable domain is every real number from 0 to 30. Decide whether the claim is correct and give the reasonable domain and range.",
